可以借 e3 兵作炮架打回，黑方赔车。 3. 为以后挺 c3 兵、让马从 d3 攻击 b2
黑炮做准备。b2 炮一旦离开 b 线，我方就能用 b0 车吃掉 b9 黑车。 } 车４平６ 12.
马六退五 { [%emt 0:01:50] [%think 10042] [%out 10346] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0]
[%cachewrite 1999] The black rook on f1 attacks my cannon on f3 along the
f-file. Nothing currently protects that cannon. - **Moving the cannon off the
f-file is bad.** The f3 cannon is the only thing between the black cannon on f7
and my f1–f0 area. If it leaves, the black cannon can capture my advisor on f0
with check. My king can't take back, because the black rook on f1 guards f0. -
**Moving the g2 knight is bad.** The black cannon on b2 would jump over my c2
cannon and the g2 knight would no longer screen it. It would then take my
elephant on i2. - **So I retreat the d3 knight to e1 (马六退五).** From e1 it
protects the f3 cannon, so taking it would cost Black the rook. It also
protects the c2 cannon and blocks the black rook from sliding left along rank
1, which keeps it hemmed in. } 炮２平７ 13. 车八进九 { [%emt 0:02:12]
[%think 12178] [%out 12463] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0] [%cachewrite 2027]
黑方上一步炮2平7吃掉了我的马，同时设下了两个陷阱： 1. **不能吃g2的炮。**
如果车三进二（g0xg2）吃炮，黑方车6进1（f1xf0）吃仕并将军。帅不能回吃f0，
因为f7的黑炮隔着我f3的炮照着f线。e1有我自己的马，d0有仕，帅无处可走，被将死。
2. **八路车受到威胁。** 黑炮离开b2后，b线打通，黑车b9直接对着我的车b0，
而我的车没有任何子保护。 所以当务之急是先兑掉这对车。车八进九吃车后，
黑方只能马7退8（c7xb9）回吃，局面上先解除丢车的危险，再想办法处理g2的炮。 }
